error: `unwrap_or_default` stands an empty `&str` in for `None`
  --> tools/dylint/examples/untyped_json_access.rs:25:82
   |
25 |     fn index(&self, key: &str) -> &str { self.0.get(key).and_then(Value::as_str).unwrap_or_default() }
   |                                                                                  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
   = help: keep the `Option` through to its reader, or `match` `Some` and `None` to choose the foreign call
   = note: `#[deny(empty_string_default)]` on by default

error: `Value::get` reads `"name"` from an untyped JSON document
  --> tools/dylint/examples/untyped_json_access.rs:50:17
   |
50 |     Ok(document.get("name").and_then(Value::as_str).map(str::to_owned))
   |                 ^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
   = help: decode the document into a struct deriving `serde::Deserialize`
   = note: `#[deny(untyped_json_access)]` on by default

